{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1337546-with-a-little-help-from-summoned-creature","id":1337546,"title":"With a little help from summoned creature","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-23T15:51:52-07:00","id":1337546,"title":"With a little help from summoned creature","content":"There is many reason to summon ephemeral creatures, but I'd like to discuss one I want to use. My character have Mind 3 and Rote for Goetia Summons, so with some preparations I can easily summon Goetia out of Temenos. Are Goetia able to help me with teamwork on extended mental tasks, as long as their Resonance is relevant for it? For example, I want to write a book. Am I able to summon Goetia of writer and get teamwork from it? How capable are Goetia of independent thought and problem-solving, which such teamwork would require? Astral Realm weren't too useful in this regard, sadly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T16:46:00-07:00","id":1337554,"title":"","content":"I think Goetia should be able to help, but that at least lower rank Goetia should be more specific than just Writer, and thus their help more limited and specific. What kind of writer? A Best Selling Author? A Starving Artist? The Critically Acclaimed Reclusive Genius or The Prolific Purveyor of Schlock? A Genre Author or a Literary Fiction one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12673-ew-matias","name":"EW-Matias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T23:23:51-07:00","id":1337593,"title":"","content":"Of course goetia can help, but remember that rank 1 have a mentality a little narrowed on their Resonance.<br /> I think that a rank 2 could be of great help if the Resonance match the theme of the book","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T03:14:27-07:00","id":1337610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EW-Matias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1337546-with-a-little-help-from-summoned-creature?p=1337554#post1337554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Goetia should be able to help, but that at least lower rank Goetia should be more specific than just Writer, and thus their help more limited and specific. What kind of writer? A Best Selling Author? A Starving Artist? The Critically Acclaimed Reclusive Genius or The Prolific Purveyor of Schlock? A Genre Author or a Literary Fiction one?</div> </div> </div> </div>Science fiction, so I would call the Goetia of Sci-fi Writer. There is also a question of how much I can specify Resonance while calling the Goetia with Goetic Summons. Can I call Goetia by Resonance of &quot;Isaac Asimov&quot;, for example? I think Isaac's Goetia would be invaluable in giving teamwork to write a continuation of &quot;Foundation&quot; novel <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T04:40:27-07:00","id":1337616,"title":"","content":"Sci-fi is a very broad category so I\u2019d narrow it down. Do you want Isaac Asimov or H.G. Wells?<br /> <br /> That will lend thematic influence to what you produce. That said, yes a goetia can totes help you write a novel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T05:00:24-07:00","id":1337618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1337546-with-a-little-help-from-summoned-creature?p=1337616#post1337616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sci-fi is a very broad category so I\u2019d narrow it down. Do you want Isaac Asimov or H.G. Wells?</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you think will happen if I call them both? Also, do you think it's possible to call specific Goetia by making very specific Resonance?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T12:01:13-07:00","id":1337666,"title":"","content":"Then you\u2019d have two assistants for your writing, and depending on how you worked with them end up with a text that reflects their styles.<br /> <br /> You don\u2019t need Resonance to summon specific goetia, you just need to know enough to call them specifically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}